  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment in Creador V L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed $60 million investment in Creador V, L.P., a targeted $600 million regional private equity fund, will enable ADB to contribute growth capital to private sector companies having significant business operations in countries in South and/or Southeast Asia with a core focus on India, Indonesia, Malaysia, Philippines, and Viet Nam.</narrative>
  </description>
